valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;width:130.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:&#xa;  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;&#xa;  mso-border-top-alt:solid black .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid black .25pt;&#xa;  mso-border-alt:solid black .25pt;padding:0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt&quot;&gt;&#xa;  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;Local vs regional&#xa;  coordination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;  &lt;/td&gt;&#xa;  &lt;td width=&quot;173&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;width:130.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:&#xa;  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;&#xa;  mso-border-top-alt:solid black .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid black .25pt;&#xa;  mso-border-alt:solid black .25pt;padding:0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt&quot;&gt;&#xa;  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;mso-comment-reference:MB_3;mso-comment-date:&#xa;  20260127T1848&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;Siloed hub operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-ansi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:&#xa;  11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;msocomanchor&quot; id=&quot;_anchor_3&quot; href=&quot;#_msocom_3&quot; name=&quot;_msoanchor_3&quot;&gt;[MB3]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:&#xa;  comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;  &lt;/td&gt;&#xa;  &lt;td width=&quot;157&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;width:118.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:&#xa;  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;&#xa;  mso-border-top-alt:solid black .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid black .25pt;&#xa;  mso-border-alt:solid black .25pt;padding:0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt&quot;&gt;&#xa;  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.0pt&quot;&gt;Federated architecture;&#xa;  cross-hub protocols&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;  &lt;/td&gt;&#xa; &lt;/tr&gt;&#xa;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div style=&quot;mso-element:comment-list&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;hr class=&quot;msocomoff&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; size=&quot;1&quot; width=&quot;33%&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div style=&quot;mso-element:comment&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div id=&quot;_com_1&quot; class=&quot;msocomtxt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-author:&#xa;&amp;quot;Michele Victoria \(sss\)&amp;quot;;mso-comment-providerid:AD;mso-comment-userid:&amp;quot;S\:\:m\.victoria\@rgu\.ac\.uk\:\:da69ad06-1b0b-4e3e-a895-0973cbd3c8c1&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_msocom_1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoCommentText&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:&#xa;8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;#_msoanchor_1&quot; class=&quot;msocomoff&quot;&gt;[MV1]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Not&#xa;sure if this is achievable but was thinking if we could provide references of&#xa;past case studies for each of these being implemented in different sectors may&#xa;be?&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div style=&quot;mso-element:comment&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div id=&quot;_com_2&quot; class=&quot;msocomtxt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-author:&#xa;&amp;quot;MAGDALENA BLAZUSIAK \(1006026\)&amp;quot;;mso-comment-providerid:AD;mso-comment-userid:&#xa;&amp;quot;S\:\:m\.blazusiak\@rgu\.ac\.uk\:\:8ea6f67d-91bd-45cd-bf2c-cc739219134c&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_msocom_2&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoCommentText&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:&#xa;8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;#_msoanchor_2&quot; class=&quot;msocomoff&quot;&gt;[MB2]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Procurement&#xa;here too? Or in collective choice, where is strengthens local supply chains&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div style=&quot;mso-element:comment&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div id=&quot;_com_3&quot; class=&quot;msocomtxt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-author:&#xa;&amp;quot;MAGDALENA BLAZUSIAK \(1006026\)&amp;quot;;mso-comment-providerid:AD;mso-comment-userid:&#xa;&amp;quot;S\:\:m\.blazusiak\@rgu\.ac\.uk\:\:8ea6f67d-91bd-45cd-bf2c-cc739219134c&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_msocom_3&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoCommentText&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:&#xa;8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;#_msoanchor_3&quot; class=&quot;msocomoff&quot;&gt;[MB3]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Is&#xa;this where accessibility of digital database comes in as well?&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1890" width="1280" x="50" y="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mJcXtoBETIn71nHMAbL8-2" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:6.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;mso-comment-reference:&#xa;TD_2;mso-comment-date:20260126T1814&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Material Registry Contract: &lt;/b&gt;Implements&#xa;P1 (Boundaries) by defining material-specific entry criteria, condition&#xa;thresholds, and certification requirements. Each registered material receives a&#xa;unique passport &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;mso-comment-reference:MV_1;mso-comment-date:20260129T1110&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-continuation:2&quot;&gt;NFT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-continuation:&#xa;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-ansi-font-size:11.0pt;&#xa;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;msocomanchor&quot; id=&quot;_anchor_1&quot; href=&quot;#_msocom_1&quot; name=&quot;_msoanchor_1&quot;&gt;[MV1]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;encoding provenance, testing results, and condition history.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:6.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-continuation:&#xa;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Marketplace Contract: &lt;/b&gt;Facilitates matching between material supply&#xa;and demand, with escrow mechanisms for secure transactions. Implements P6&#xa;(Conflict Resolution) through programmed dispute procedures and graduated&#xa;release conditions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:6.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-continuation:&#xa;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quality Assurance Contract: &lt;/b&gt;Integrates with certified testing&#xa;facilities to record inspection results on-chain. Implements P4 (Monitoring)&#xa;through distributed verification protocols and immutable audit trails.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:10.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-continuation:&#xa;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;IoT Oracle Contract: &lt;/b&gt;Bridges physical and digital realms by ingesting&#xa;sensor data (moisture, temperature, structural integrity) and triggering smart&#xa;contract events based on predefined thresholds. Enables real-time monitoring&#xa;without centralised data custody.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-ansi-font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;msocomanchor&quot; id=&quot;_anchor_2&quot; href=&quot;#_msocom_2&quot; name=&quot;_msoanchor_2&quot;&gt;[TD2]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div style=&quot;mso-element:comment-list&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;hr class=&quot;msocomoff&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; size=&quot;1&quot; width=&quot;33%&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div style=&quot;mso-element:comment&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div id=&quot;_com_1&quot; class=&quot;msocomtxt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-author:&#xa;&amp;quot;Michele Victoria \(sss\)&amp;quot;;mso-comment-providerid:AD;mso-comment-userid:&amp;quot;S\:\:m\.victoria\@rgu\.ac\.uk\:\:da69ad06-1b0b-4e3e-a895-0973cbd3c8c1&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_msocom_1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoCommentText&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:&#xa;8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;#_msoanchor_1&quot; class=&quot;msocomoff&quot;&gt;[MV1]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Need&#xa;to define the acronym&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div style=&quot;mso-element:comment&quot;&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;div id=&quot;_com_2&quot; class=&quot;msocomtxt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-comment-author:&#xa;&amp;quot;Theo Dounas&amp;quot;;mso-comment-providerid:None;mso-comment-userid:&amp;quot;Theo Dounas&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_msocom_2&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;MsoCommentReference&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;mso-special-character:comment&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;#_msoanchor_2&quot; class=&quot;msocomoff&quot;&gt;[TD2]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt&quot;&gt;@Hico McD- any other SC that we might be missing?&#xa;should the material contract be a material and component? if we are using token&#xa;voting then we need also a fungible token for voting? is this the same for&#xa;transactions? -in general this takes care for the material and component&#xa;passport, but does not take care of the cryptoeconomics-&lt;span style=&quot;mso-spacerun:yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;please input any ideas to improve these&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1010" width="560" x="880" y="1190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
